# @makersbrain packages come from GitHub Packages, not npmjs.com, and npm has no
# way to discover that on its own.
#
# There is no credential here on purpose. Authentication lives in ~/.npmrc for a
# person, and in CI it is written from the workflow's own GITHUB_TOKEN; the image
# build takes it as a BuildKit secret so it never lands in a layer. See
# .npmrc.example for both.
@makersbrain:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
